I wake up every morning at seven o'clock.
Right now, my apartment is very quiet.
There is good sunlight outside today.
I open my window.
Then I go to the kitchen.
I make a cup of fresh coffee for myself.
The aroma of the coffee is very good.
I sit near the window.
I peacefully drink my coffee.
Now I get ready for the office.
I take out my laptop bag.
I put my laptop in the bag.
I check my essential things.
My keys are on the table.
I keep the keys and wallet in the bag.
I take my phone too.
Now I am completely ready.
I come out of the apartment.
I close the door.
I lock the door.
